<title>USA: CBOT soybean futures crush margins.</title>
<headline>CBOT soybean futures crush margins.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following soybean crush margins are based on CBOT settlements and the assumption that one bushel of soybeans yields 11 lbs of oil and 44 lbs of meal, with four lbs of hulls. (quotes in cts/bu)</p>
<p> Jan-97	 61.30    up   0.49</p>
<p> Mar-97	 52.28    up   0.09</p>
<p> May-97	 44.31    dn   0.17</p>
<p> Jul-97	 45.14    dn   1.34</p>
<p> Aug-97	 46.38    dn   1.17</p>
<p> Sep-97	 46.16    dn   5.03</p>
<p> Oct/Nov-97   54.05    dn   2.45</p>
<p> Nov/Dec-97   57.90    dn   1.90</p>
</text>
